        "cooked": "<p>I'm not sure it makes her easy but it certainly hurts her strategy. &nbsp; Chrono-Ranger has bounty that could do the same. &nbsp;In regards to Plague Rat he is just about the damage that gets out of control when he loses those Handlers.</p>",
